msgid "The node did not answer with the fixed read script"
msgstr "Nọdụ ahụ ejighị edemede ọgụgụ e debere zaa"

#: lib/ReadError.php
msgid "The response ended before the read script finished"
msgstr "Azịza ahụ kwụsịrị tupu edemede ọgụgụ agwụchaa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Access"
msgstr "Ịnweta Nọdụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the ssh client on each poller that reads nodes."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke gaa na klaiyentị ssh na poller ọ bụla na-agụ nọdụ."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Client"
msgstr "Klaiyentị SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path, on each poller that reads nodes, to the private key whose public half each node lists in authorized_keys with a forced command running pfs-read.sh. Readable only by the poller user. The plugin never creates, copies, or prints it."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke, na poller ọ bụla na-agụ nọdụ, gaa na igodo nzuzo nke nọdụ ọ bụla depụtara akụkụ ọha ya na authorized_keys yana iwu mmanye nke na-agba pfs-read.sh. Naanị onye ọrụ poller nwere ike ịgụ ya. Ngwa mgbakwunye anaghị emepụta, depụtaghachi, ma ọ bụ bipụta ya ma ọlị."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Key File"
msgstr "Faịlụ Igodo SSH"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the known_hosts file holding each node host key under the node endpoint name. A node whose key is missing or changed is not read."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke gaa na faịlụ known_hosts nke ji igodo host nke nọdụ ọ bụla n'okpuru aha ebe nkwụsị nọdụ ahụ. A naghị agụ nọdụ nke igodo ya furu efu ma ọ bụ gbanwere."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Known Hosts File"
msgstr "Faịlụ Known Hosts"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Oke Oge Njikọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds to wait for a node to accept the connection."
msgstr "Sekọnd a ga-eche ka nọdụ nabata njikọ ahụ."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Oke Oge Ọgụgụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Sekọnd otu ọgụgụ nọdụ nwere ike iwere na mkpokọta tupu a kwụsị ya ma dekọọ ya dị ka nke kụrụ afọ n'ala."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB otu nọdụ nwere ike iweghachi. A na-atụfu azịza buru ibu karịa ma dekọọ ya dị ka nke kụrụ afọ n'ala."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Azịza Kachasị"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Ngwa Ọgụgụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Oke Oge Ngwa Ọgụgụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Sekọnd otu ọsọ ngwa ọgụgụ nwere ike iji tupu ọ kwụsị ịmalite ọgụgụ nọdụ. Debe ya n'okpuru oge poller; a ga-agụ nọdụ a na-agụghị n'ọsọ na-esote."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Ọgụgụ N'otu Oge"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Ọgụgụ nọdụ nke otu ngwa ọgụgụ na-agba n'otu oge."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Wepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Debe Tebụl Mgbakwunye Mgbe A Na-ewepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Mgbe a kanyere ya akara, iwepụ ngwa mgbakwunye na-edobe sistemụ faịlụ ya, nọdụ, ndepụta ngwa, na cache. Hichapụ akara ahụ ka iwepụ ahụ wepụ ha; buru ụzọ zipụta ndekọ aha site na ibe Nchịkwa Parallel Filesystem. A naghị akpọtụrụ nọdụ nchekwa n'ụzọ ọ bụla."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Hichapụ Ngwaọrụ Ngwa Mgbakwunye A Mepụtara Mgbe A Na-ewepụ Ya"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Mgbe a kanyere ya akara, iwepụ ngwa mgbakwunye na-ehichapụ ngwaọrụ o mepụtara maka sistemụ faịlụ, yana eserese ha na isi iyi data ha, dị ka ihichapụ ha na Cacti ga-eme. A naghị ehichapụ ngwaọrụ dị adị e jikọtara na sistemụ faịlụ ma ọlị. A na-ewepụ faịlụ RRD naanị ma ọ bụrụ na ntọala nhicha RRD nke Cacti n'onwe ya wepụ ha. Ọ bụrụ na e wepụrụ akara ahụ, ngwaọrụ ndị ahụ ga-adịgide."

