msgstr "E chekwara sistemụ faịlụ ahụ."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "E hichapụrụ sistemụ faịlụ ahụ, nọdụ ya, na ndepụta ngwa ya. E debere ngwaọrụ Cacti ya, isi iyi data ya, na eserese ya. A kpọtụghị nọdụ ọ bụla."

